{"product_id":"the-lady-grace-mysteries-deception","title":"The Lady Grace Mysteries: Deception","description":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone at the Royal Court was so excited today - the marvellous Frost Fair has come to London, and we all went ice skating! But there was a terrible discovery when the body of a man was found at the edge of the frozen river.Why was he killed, and what is the meaning of the silver coins placed over his eyes? Are they a message - or a warning? As the Queen's own special investigator, I, Lady Grace, must uncover the truth . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Grace Cavendish\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781862303799\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809855430809,"sku":"17RB-5-9781862303799","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f79d4f338ca_The_Lady_Grace_Mysteries-_Deception_Grace_Cavendish.jpg?v=1761070090","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-lady-grace-mysteries-deception","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}